      "role": "Cross-speaker thread",
      "title": "Case 1 — Cross-speaker thread",
      "target_en": "A man livestreams in a miniskirt",
      "target_zh": "男子穿短裙丝袜街边直播",
      "gold_name": "neutral",
      "pred_name": "neutral",
      "relation_importance": {
        "speaker": 0.2912,
        "dialogue": 0.1658,
        "temporal": 0.3345,
        "reply": 0.2084
      },
      "target_semantic_preference": {
        "background": 0.2961,
        "favor": 0.3246,
        "against": 0.3793
      },
      "reply_analysis": {
        "prob_immediate_previous": 0.2516,
        "max_history_prob": 0.2809,
        "prob_root": 0.0
      },
      "utterances": [
        {
          "turn": 0,
          "utterance_id": 0,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 0,
          "gold_turn_name": "favor",
          "text": "男的穿丝袜短裙会触犯什么法律吗？",
          "text_en": "Is a man in a skirt breaking the law?"
        },
        {
          "turn": 1,
          "utterance_id": 1,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "gold_turn_name": "against",
          "text": "有一个东西叫民法典",
          "text_en": "The Civil Code."
        },
        {
          "turn": 2,
          "utterance_id": 2,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 10,
          "gold_turn_name": "favor",
          "text": "可是民法典里面规定的内容不应该是法院来决定的吗，警察怎么会根据民法典规定内容执法呢，不应该是治安管理处罚法或者刑法吗",
          "text_en": "Police do not enforce the Civil Code."
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "utterance_id": 3,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "gold_turn_name": "neutral",
          "text": "我不知道说什么好，给我整不会了，哎，还是您自己体会吧",
          "text_en": "Work it out yourself."
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "utterance_id": 4,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 10,
          "gold_turn_name": "favor",
          "text": "我就是公安啊，我真不知道我怎么体会，你要是知道你告诉一下我呗，民法典里面对高空抛物有提到公安要参与，但是最后涉事还是要用治安管理处罚法或者刑法，其余的民法典里面规定的适用于公安执法吗？",
          "text_en": "I am police. Does the Civil Code cover other policing?"
        },
        {
          "turn": 5,
          "utterance_id": 5,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 24,
          "gold_turn_name": "neutral",
          "text": "您是警察那就被别人普及一下呗，要么非要在这阴阳怪气",
          "text_en": "If you are police, listen instead of being sarcastic."
        },
        {
          "turn": 6,
          "utterance_id": 6,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 10,
          "gold_turn_name": "neutral",
          "text": "我就是在讨论啊，哪里有阴阳怪气……是他让我自己体会啊，倒是你上来就会指责人",
          "text_en": "I am discussing, not being sarcastic."
        },
        {
          "turn": 7,
          "utterance_id": 7,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 24,
          "gold_turn_name": "neutral",
          "text": "他是见你披着警察这套皮不和您争辩，您自己都搬出来了，能不给您个面子嘛！？",
          "text_en": "He backed off to give you face."
        },
        {
          "turn": 8,
          "utterance_id": 8,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 10,
          "gold_turn_name": "neutral",
          "text": "我要这面子有什么用，我觉得这是学术这是法律问题，不是面子问题，是他自己在各种杠，大家给他普法他听吗？合理讨论有人参与吗？那你可以说说啊，这里有什么法律依据…且现在他是不回复吗，他是已经不回复所有人了",
          "text_en": "I don't need face. This is law. What's the basis? He already quit."
        }
      ],
