    {
      "case_id": 2,
      "doc_id": 2563,
      "role": "Speaker history",
      "title": "Case 2 — Speaker history",
      "target_en": "Must delete the ex after a breakup",
      "target_zh": "分手后一定要删除对方",
      "gold_name": "neutral",
      "pred_name": "neutral",
      "relation_importance": {
        "speaker": 0.3083,
        "dialogue": 0.1736,
        "temporal": 0.3002,
        "reply": 0.2179
      },
      "target_semantic_preference": {
        "background": 0.7555,
        "favor": 0.0535,
        "against": 0.191
      },
      "reply_analysis": {
        "prob_immediate_previous": 0.1427,
        "max_history_prob": 0.3577,
        "prob_root": 0.0001
      },
      "utterances": [
        {
          "turn": 0,
          "utterance_id": 0,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 0,
          "gold_turn_name": "favor",
          "text": "为什么不删？留着膈应现任吗",
          "text_en": "Why keep the chat? To annoy the new partner?"
        },
        {
          "turn": 1,
          "utterance_id": 1,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "gold_turn_name": "against",
          "text": "不觉得删了，反而很难走出来吗？没删反而把他给忘了，一干二净了。",
          "text_en": "Deleting makes it harder to move on."
        },
        {
          "turn": 2,
          "utterance_id": 2,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 12,
          "gold_turn_name": "against",
          "text": "我是觉得会删的人就是知道自己忍不住会去找前任和了解他的近况",
          "text_en": "People who delete still want to check on the ex."
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "utterance_id": 3,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "gold_turn_name": "against",
          "text": "删了就感觉好像是我还离不开他一样。不删，我会忘得快。",
          "text_en": "Deleting feels like I still cannot let go."
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "utterance_id": 4,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 21,
          "gold_turn_name": "favor",
          "text": "删了才是离开的一干二净啊",
          "text_en": "Deleting is a clean break."
        },
        {
          "turn": 5,
          "utterance_id": 5,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "gold_turn_name": "against",
          "text": "既然说分手了，就是会一干二净呀，为什么会觉得有了微信就会有还会有复合呢。反正我是分的很干净的，只要一说分手，我绝不会再找复合。",
          "text_en": "A breakup is already a clean break. I never go back."
        },
        {
          "turn": 6,
          "utterance_id": 6,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 21,
          "gold_turn_name": "favor",
          "text": "那就删了呗，既然不会复合，心里都不占了，还占那个内存干啥",
          "text_en": "Then delete it. Why keep the chat?"
        },
        {
          "turn": 7,
          "utterance_id": 7,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "gold_turn_name": "neutral",
          "text": "会删，但不会马上说分手就删，因为我分手，不会吵吵闹闹的。因为都是我先说的分手。",
          "text_en": "I will delete, but not the second we break up."
        },
        {
          "turn": 8,
          "utterance_id": 8,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 21,
          "gold_turn_name": "neutral",
          "text": "可以可以删其实也可以很安静的删，不一定吵吵闹闹，还有，先分手的也不代表是占上风或者先放下那个不能代表什么",
          "text_en": "Saying it first is not winning."
        },
        {
          "turn": 9,
          "utterance_id": 9,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "gold_turn_name": "neutral",
          "text": "没有那么想，先说分手就沾上风。分手我们都是很和平的，分手我都是说清楚我们分手的原因我们存在什么问题。不会因为说什么我先说的分手而感到怎么样这样子。",
          "text_en": "I don't see it as winning. We split calmly. I just said why."
        }
      ],
