          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "gold_turn_name": "favor",
          "text": "千万的善款不能养活她吗？还要多少？",
          "text_en": "Can't the donations support her?"
        },
        {
          "turn": 2,
          "utterance_id": 2,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "gold_turn_name": "against",
          "text": "？？？？？没看人家捐款？？？？？？？？？？？",
          "text_en": "Did you not see that she donated?"
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "utterance_id": 3,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "gold_turn_name": "neutral",
          "text": "想看捐款截图关注我私发给你，给你看小部分你不震撼我都不信。这里评论不让贴图",
          "text_en": "I can send screenshots privately."
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "utterance_id": 4,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "gold_turn_name": "against",
          "text": "还有你的理解能力有误，我回复你的意思是江歌妈妈对外捐款了",
          "text_en": "I meant she donated to others."
        },
        {
          "turn": 5,
          "utterance_id": 5,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "gold_turn_name": "favor",
          "text": "你的理解能力也差，我说的是她捐给公益组织的69万，是刘鑫给他的赔偿款，善款一分没捐，看懂了吗？",
          "text_en": "She donated compensation, not the public funds."
        },
        {
          "turn": 6,
          "utterance_id": 6,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 25,
          "gold_turn_name": "against",
          "text": "这你都能喷也是可以的，巴不得苦命人一辈子命苦，终日以泪洗面，坏人逍遥法外就是对的是吧？你管她拿的是什么钱捐的，捐了是真，捐多少还配你管了",
          "text_en": "Why attack this? Who is the villain here?"
        },
        {
          "turn": 7,
          "utterance_id": 7,
          "node_index": -1,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "gold_turn_name": "neutral",
          "text": "谁是坏人搞清楚了没？搞清楚再来说话",
          "text_en": "Who is the villain? Get that straight first."
        }
      ],
